<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  RUT_FleetFlier.xml                     UtinniPatches - COMMISSION_LEDGER_CLEANUP_1

  Resolves ledger slug `the_forge:fleet-fliers-small-darting-fireweed-eaters`
  (design/Jawa/worldbuilding/biomes/the_forge.md §4: "The fleet fliers -
  small darting things that race in, eat fireweed, and retreat before they
  perish"; roster's own new_defs entry, flora_assignment_register.decisions.json
  ledger:the_forge:fleet-fliers-small-darting-fireweed-eaters, decision "in").
  A genuinely NEW creature, not a reskin: the roster's own note already
  recorded "no small donor flier passes heat-adapted; register flies flag
  broken so no candidate is provable anyway" — checked again this pass
  (cast_assignment.csv, no unclaimed small heat-adapted flier anywhere in the
  live cast) before authoring anything new, same discipline the poison_forest
  wave's VentStalker slug used.

  Fireweed itself needs no new def: `Plant_Fireweed` (Odyssey vanilla) is
  already wired into RUT_TheForge.xml's own wildPlants at 0.9 — the "eat
  fireweed" half of this slug was already built long before this pass; only
  the creature was owed.

  Mechanics: rides FORGE_MECHANICS_1's already-shipped F3 sky-fauna kit
  wholesale, zero new C#. `CompProperties_VaporDrifter` (RimMandrake.
  EnvironmentalHazards) is added with `forageRadiusBeyondColumns 12` -
  literally the class's own doc comment naming this exact figure for "a
  concrete fleet-flier kind" (RM_CompVaporDrifter.cs). `groundHazardImmune`
  is left at its class default (true): floating above the vent columns
  keeps them clear of scald bursts, matching the sheet's "sky herds" framing.
  No MayRequire on the class reference - matches this same file family's own
  precedent (RUT_DyingCreep.xml/RUT_TibannaGas.xml both reference
  RimMandrake.EnvironmentalHazards classes bare; the mod's own About.xml has
  no formal dependency on mandrake.rm.environmentalhazards at all, a
  pre-existing gap this pass did not invent and is out of this slug's scope
  to fix).

  "Retreat before they perish" is read as a REAL mechanical consequence, not
  flavor text only: ComfyTemperatureMax (38) sits just under the biome's own
  measured 42-56C floor (the_forge.md §0), so a fleet flier that lingers on
  the ground (rather than staying aloft in the immune columns) starts taking
  ordinary heatstroke - unlike Beldon/Aerofleet's wide -100..100 comfort
  band, this species is NOT heat-adapted on the ground, only shielded while
  airborne over a column. `leaveMapOnFleeChance 0.7` + `flightStartChanceOnJobStart
  0.4` push the same "darts in, darts out" read into ordinary wildlife AI
  (same knobs RSW_Porg's own flight profile already uses, scaled up for a
  more skittish species).

  Native 1.6 flight (MaxFlightTime/FlightCooldown/race flight fields), not
  VEF floating - CLAUDE.md's standing "if it flies in the fiction, it flies
  in the game" law, and this is a from-scratch creature with no donor
  float-comp to inherit. No flyingAnimationFramePathPrefix: no frame art
  exists yet and the law is explicit that flight is never blocked waiting on
  frames - it flies with no wing-beat animation until a later art pass adds
  a flip-book.

  Live birth (gestationPeriodDays + litterSizeCurve), not CompProperties_
  EggLayer: an avian-styled RaceProps.body is not required to lay eggs
  (RimWorld birds do both in different vanilla/mod defs), and inventing a
  bespoke small egg ThingDef pair for a single low-priority roster slug would
  be scope creep this pass does not need.

  Art: genuinely new, no existing render found (checked infrastructure/
  artpipe/{done,pending,registry.jsonl} and design/ for "fireweed"/
  "fleetflier"/"fleet-flier"/"fleet flier" - only hits are the unrelated
  firevine_fireweed_v1 plant job and this file's own C# precedent comment).
  Three facing jobs filed this pass (south/east/north; west mirrors east per
  the engine's own convention) - rutfleetflier_v1_{south,east,north}.json.
  texPath points at this mod's own new Things/Pawn/Animal/RUT_FleetFlier
  path (this mod already ships a Things/Pawn/Animal tree, so
  validate_patch.py's own-namespace heuristic correctly hard-errors the
  missing file rather than silently accepting a borrowed vanilla icon - same
  accepted "expected pending-texPath" class as RUT_DarkCrust/RUT_Fuzz, no
  DEPLOY_HOLD.txt entry needed per that same precedent, since this item's
  scope is offline-only and nothing here is being deployed).
-->
<Defs>

  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>RUT_FleetFlier</defName>
    <label>fleet flier</label>
    <description>A small, quick-winged creature that darts into the Forge's vapor columns to graze on fireweed before the heat catches up with it. It never lingers - a fleet flier on the open ground is a fleet flier running out of time.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MoveSpeed>4.2</MoveSpeed>
      <ComfyTemperatureMin>-20</ComfyTemperatureMin>
      <ComfyTemperatureMax>38</ComfyTemperatureMax>
      <MarketValue>55</MarketValue>
      <Wildness>0.9</Wildness>
      <MaxFlightTime>15</MaxFlightTime>
      <FlightCooldown>4</FlightCooldown>
    </statBases>
    <tools>
      <li>
        <label>claws</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>Scratch</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>1.5</power>
        <cooldownTime>1.5</cooldownTime>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>Feet</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
      </li>
      <li>
        <label>beak</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>Bite</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>2</power>
        <cooldownTime>2</cooldownTime>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>Beak</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
      </li>
    </tools>
    <comps>
      <li Class="RimMandrake.EnvironmentalHazards.CompProperties_VaporDrifter">
        <forageRadiusBeyondColumns>12</forageRadiusBeyondColumns>
        <groundHazardImmune>true</groundHazardImmune>
      </li>
    </comps>
    <race>
      <body>Bird</body>
      <predator>false</predator>
      <baseBodySize>0.12</baseBodySize>
      <baseHungerRate>0.4</baseHungerRate>
      <baseHealthScale>0.3</baseHealthScale>
      <foodType>VegetarianRoughAnimal</foodType>
      <herdAnimal>true</herdAnimal>
      <roamMtbDays>3</roamMtbDays>
      <trainability>None</trainability>
      <manhunterOnDamageChance>0.05</manhunterOnDamageChance>
      <manhunterOnTameFailChance>0.02</manhunterOnTameFailChance>
      <lifeExpectancy>5</lifeExpectancy>
      <gestationPeriodDays>3</gestationPeriodDays>
      <flightStartChanceOnJobStart>0.4</flightStartChanceOnJobStart>
      <canFlyIntoMap>true</canFlyIntoMap>
      <canLeaveMapFlying>true</canLeaveMapFlying>
      <leaveMapOnFleeChance>0.7</leaveMapOnFleeChance>
      <litterSizeCurve>
        <points>
          <li>(0.5, 0)</li>
          <li>(1, 1)</li>
          <li>(2, 1.2)</li>
          <li>(2.5, 0)</li>
        </points>
      </litterSizeCurve>
      <lifeStageAges>
        <li>
          <def>AnimalBabyTiny</def>
          <minAge>0</minAge>
        </li>
        <li>
          <def>AnimalJuvenile</def>
          <minAge>0.1</minAge>
        </li>
        <li>
          <def>AnimalAdult</def>
          <minAge>0.25</minAge>
        </li>
      </lifeStageAges>
      <soundMeleeHitPawn>Pawn_Melee_SmallScratch_HitPawn</soundMeleeHitPawn>
      <soundMeleeHitBuilding>Pawn_Melee_SmallScratch_HitBuilding</soundMeleeHitBuilding>
      <soundMeleeMiss>Pawn_Melee_SmallScratch_Miss</soundMeleeMiss>
      <soundEating>Bird_Eat</soundEating>
    </race>
    <tradeTags>
      <li>AnimalExotic</li>
    </tradeTags>
  </ThingDef>

  <PawnKindDef ParentName="AnimalKindBase">
    <defName>RUT_FleetFlier</defName>
    <label>fleet flier</label>
    <race>RUT_FleetFlier</race>
    <combatPower>12</combatPower>
    <wildGroupSize>3~8</wildGroupSize>
    <ecoSystemWeight>0.3</ecoSystemWeight>
    <lifeStages>
      <li>
        <bodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/RUT_FleetFlier/RUT_FleetFlier</texPath>
          <graphicClass>Graphic_Multi</graphicClass>
          <drawSize>0.35</drawSize>
        </bodyGraphicData>
      </li>
      <li>
        <bodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/RUT_FleetFlier/RUT_FleetFlier</texPath>
          <graphicClass>Graphic_Multi</graphicClass>
          <drawSize>0.55</drawSize>
        </bodyGraphicData>
      </li>
      <li>
        <bodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/RUT_FleetFlier/RUT_FleetFlier</texPath>
          <graphicClass>Graphic_Multi</graphicClass>
          <drawSize>0.75</drawSize>
        </bodyGraphicData>
      </li>
    </lifeStages>
  </PawnKindDef>

</Defs>
